      "Dismiss": ["Schlie\xDFen", "\u5173\u95ED"],
      "Landscape mode is not available in this browser. Rotate the device manually.": ["Der Querformatmodus ist in diesem Browser nicht verf\xFCgbar. Drehen Sie das Ger\xE4t manuell.", "\u6B64\u6D4F\u89C8\u5668\u4E0D\u652F\u6301\u6A2A\u5C4F\u6A21\u5F0F\u3002\u8BF7\u624B\u52A8\u65CB\u8F6C\u8BBE\u5907\u3002"],
